msgstr ""
"Tornar a comprebar qué voces y modelos d'ElevenLabs puede usar esta cuenta"

msgid "ElevenLabs API Key"
msgstr "Clau d'API d'ElevenLabs"

msgid "&API key:"
msgstr "Clau d'&API:"

msgid "Paste your ElevenLabs API key first."
msgstr "Apega primero a tuya clau d'API d'ElevenLabs."

msgid "Checking the API key with ElevenLabs..."
msgstr "Comprebando a clau d'API con ElevenLabs..."

msgid "The API key could not be checked. See the NVDA log for details."
msgstr "No s'ha puesto comprebar a clau d'API. Veye o rechistro de NVDA pa mas detalles."

msgid "The API key could not be saved. See the NVDA log for details."
msgstr "No s'ha puesto alzar a clau d'API. Veye o rechistro de NVDA pa mas detalles."

msgid "ElevenLabs TTS"
msgstr "ElevenLabs TTS"

msgid "Clear &API key"
msgstr "Borrar a clau d'&API"

msgid "Set &API key..."
msgstr "Establir a clau d'&API..."

msgid "Clear the ElevenLabs API key? ElevenLabs can't speak until a new key is set."
msgstr "Borrar a clau d'API d'ElevenLabs? ElevenLabs no podrá charrar dica que s'establezca una nueva clau."

msgid "The API key could not be cleared. See the NVDA log for details."
msgstr "No s'ha puesto borrar a clau d'API. Veye o rechistro de NVDA pa mas detalles."

msgid "ElevenLabs rejected this API key. Check that it was copied in full and that it is allowed to read voices."
msgstr "ElevenLabs ha refusau esta clau d'API. Comprebe que s'haiga copiau entera y que tienga permiso pa leyer voces."

msgid "ElevenLabs could not check the key (HTTP {code}). Try again later."
msgstr "ElevenLabs no ha puesto comprebar a clau (HTTP {code}). Torna-lo a intentar mas tarde."

msgid "Could not reach ElevenLabs to check the key. Check your internet connection and try again."
msgstr "No s'ha puesto contactar con ElevenLabs pa comprebar a clau. Comprebe a tuya connexión a internet y torna-lo a intentar."

#. Translators: Long description to be shown for this add-on on add-on information from add-on store
msgid "Speech synthesizer driver that streams audio from the ElevenLabs text-to-speech API."
msgstr "Controlador de sintetizador de voz que transmite audio dende la API de texto a voz d'ElevenLabs."

#. Translators: what's new content for the add-on version to be shown in the add-on store
msgid ""
"All settings and messages within the add-on are now localized.\n"
"If the ElevenLabs API suddenly becomes unavailable during a session, NVDA now reverts to using eSpeak instead of becoming silent."
msgstr ""
"Totas as configuracions y mensaches d'o complemento son agora localizaus.\n"
"Si la API d'ElevenLabs deixa de estar disponible de sopetón mientres una sesión, NVDA agora torna a eSpeak en cuenta de quedar-se en silencio."
